@base = http://localhost:3000

### Registro → 201 (sin password_hash en la respuesta)
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ruru Admin", "email": "ruru.admin@turnofacil.com", "password": "Admin12345" }

### Registro repetido → 409
POST {{base}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ruru Admin", "email": "ruru.admin@turnofacil.com", "password": "Admin12345" }

### Login con contraseña incorrecta → 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ruru.admin@turnofacil.com", "password": "incorrecta" }

### Login 200 con token
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ruru.admin@turnofacil.com", "password": "Admin12345" }

### Mis datos 200
GET {{base}}/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Sin token 401
GET {{base}}/auth/yo
